   139	|---|---|---|
   140	| The descent recurrence computes the actual positive maximal Cartan-disjoint ideal | PROVED | `proof.md` §§2–3; `evidence/descent-audit.md` §§2–4 |
   141	| Original relations plus generator brackets compute the whole positive Serre ideal | PROVED | `proof.md` §4 |
