   143	| Every rank-three GCM has equality at all degrees with a zero/one coordinate, hence through height five | PROVED | `proof.md` §7 corollary |
   144	| A first rank-three defect must have every coordinate >=2 and A alpha<=0 | PROVED | `proof.md` §§7–8 |
